		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Dreadmaul Rock is a great spur of stone in the east of {link:burning-steppes}the Steppes{/link}, rich in ore and riddled with caves and mines. The Firegut ogres hold it for the {link:blackrock-mountain}Blackrock{/link}, and their mages and brutes guard every path. A platoon of the {link:horde}Horde{/link} came here to learn what strange rites the ogres were performing. None of them came back. One of their number, Sha'ni Proudtusk, was chained upon an altar at the summit by the {link:ogres}ogre{/link} {link:krom-grul}Krom'Grul{/link}, and her spirit has not left that place. It was at the top of this same rock that the soldiers of {link:morgan-s-vigil}Morgan's Vigil{/link} once planted the head of an ogre lord on a pike.]=],
