		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Ruins of Thaurissan are all that remains above ground of the first city of the {link:dark-iron-dwarves}Dark Irons{/link}, in the middle of {link:burning-steppes}the Steppes{/link}. It was swallowed when its own thane called up the Firelord. Broken walls and fallen halls still smoulder among the ashes. Relics of the city lie scattered in the rubble, and they are said to hold the memory of what happened here. The Dark Irons have not forgotten the place: spies, agents and firewalkers of their emperor guard it, and war reavers walk its streets. Somewhere among the stones lies the Tablet of the Seven, written in praise of seven dwarves of great knowledge.]=],
