			text = [=[Windsor was not mad. He came out of the mountain with his stolen notes in his hands, and he passed through {link:morgan-s-vigil}Morgan's Vigil{/link} like a storm, bound for {link:stormwind-city}Stormwind{/link}. He would confront the regent, he said, and the lady who stands at the regent's side. Maxwell sent word after him that his deputy should meet him at the gates of the city, and should not go alone. What Windsor meant to reveal would shake the kingdom to its foundations.]=],
