				{ type = "quest", id = 5081 },
				{ type = "quest", id = 5102 },
			},
			text = [=[A goblin spy who had crept through the Spire sent Maxwell a map. It confirmed what he suspected. The {link:blackrock-mountain}Blackrock{/link} were beasts of burden and fodder for the black dragonflight, and their true lord was {red:nefarian}Nefarian{/red}, son of {link:deathwing}Deathwing{/link}. Maxwell marked the war master, the {link:ogres}ogre{/link} highlord and the overlord of the citadel for death. Later a letter was taken from the body of a dragonkin in the Spire, written by its superior, {red:general-drakkisath}General Drakkisath{/red}. Maxwell marked the general too. He said that the war was fought on two fronts: from within {link:stormwind-city}Stormwind{/link}, and here, at the enemy's gate.]=],
